Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Did you know that our Earth\Nis like a giant spinning top?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.49,0:00:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It spins really fast
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.52,0:00:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}about 1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}600 kilometers per hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}That's much faster than even\Nthe fastest car you can\Nimagine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.30,0:00:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}But here’s something\Ncurious: we don’t feel a\Nthing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.92,0:00:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}You might wonder why we\Ndon't get dizzy or fly off the\Nsurface
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}it's all thanks to a clever\Nforce called gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.61,0:00:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Imagine it like an invisible\Nhand holding you snugly to\Nthe ground
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}like when
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.69,0:00:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}you’re tucked under a cozy\Nblanket
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.69,0:00:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}And here’s another cool\Npart of the story: the air\Naround us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.19,0:00:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}called the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}atmosphere
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}spins right along with Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.76,0:00:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It’s like when you sit on a\Nmerry-go-round with all your\Nfriends
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.25,0:00:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Because everything moves\Ntogether — the trees
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.68,0:00:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}buildings
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.21,0:00:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}and even you — all in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.32,0:00:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}one big
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.77,0:00:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}steady swirl
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.49,0:00:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}you don’t feel like you’re\Nspinning at all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.81,0:00:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Next time you’re outside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.15,0:00:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}look at the sky and\Nremember that although it\Nfeels
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.89,0:00:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}calm and still
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.64,0:00:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}we’re all gliding along this\Namazing ride through space
